{"title":"Rimeworm","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 62 Rimeworm that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">stab</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 15% damage (the game's own rule). Monsters have no resistances.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimeworm\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimeworm?lv=61\">Lv 61 <span>26</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/rimeworm?lv=62\">Lv 62 <span>43</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/rimeworm?lv=63\">Lv 63 <span>25</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimeworm?lv=61\" title=\"Pick level 61\"><td><b>61</b></td><td>462</td><td>38.1</td><td>3,050</td><td class=\"muted\">1,386 · 53.3 · 9,150</td><td>26</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimeworm\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>62</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>469</td><td>38.6</td><td>3,100</td><td class=\"muted\">1,407 · 54 · 9,300</td><td>43</td><td>in the wilds around 52, -1182</td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/rimeworm?lv=63\" title=\"Pick level 63\"><td><b>63</b></td><td>476</td><td>39.2</td><td>3,150</td><td class=\"muted\">1,428 · 54.9 · 9,450</td><td>25</td><td>in the wilds around 37, -1101</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"rimeworm\" data-map-level=\"62\">Show level 62 on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 10 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 15 recorded drops, 500 total, 15–57 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×15–57</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"rimeworm-tooth\" title=\"Rimeworm Tooth - in 9 of 10 looted corpses, 9 recorded drops, 13 total, 1–2 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/491f87c5a54171330506.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rimeworm Tooth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1.1<br>×1–2</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 1 of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"rimeworm-gizzard-stone\" title=\"Rimeworm Gizzard Stone - in 1 of 10 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/4e4c2422a7299dd24c53.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rimeworm Gizzard Stone</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/10<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden clas